WEBVTT

00:00:04.207 --> 00:00:04.754
Hi there!

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:08.646
In this video, I'm going to walk
you through how to use HUNGRY's

00:00:08.646 --> 00:00:12.781
Group Ordering experience — from
setting up your account preferences

00:00:12.781 --> 00:00:15.910
to browsing the menu
and placing your order.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:20.135
I'll also show you a few helpful
features you can set up to make

00:00:20.135 --> 00:00:24.361
ordering even easier each week,
including your default location,

00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:29.049
dietary preferences, allergen
alerts, and order reminders.

00:00:29.049 --> 00:00:32.951
First, make sure you're ordering
for the correct location.

00:00:32.951 --> 00:00:35.969
If you have access to
multiple office locations,

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:39.752
you can select the location
you're ordering for here.

00:00:39.752 --> 00:00:45.837
You can also set the office you order
from most often as your default location.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:49.813
Once it's set, HUNGRY will
automatically take you to that location

00:00:49.813 --> 00:00:53.820
when you log in, so you don't
have to select it every time.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:59.155
You can always switch locations later
if you need to order somewhere else.

00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:03.557
Before we place an order, let's
take a look at your preferences.

00:01:03.557 --> 00:01:09.310
Here, you can personalize your HUNGRY
experience based on how you like to order.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:14.168
Setting these preferences upfront makes
it easier to find meals that work for

00:01:14.168 --> 00:01:19.567
you and helps HUNGRY personalize your
ordering experience going forward.

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:24.117
Within your preferences, you
can also set up allergen alerts.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:28.121
Select any allergens that are
important for you to be aware of.

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:32.125
Once saved, HUNGRY will use these
preferences to help call your

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:36.199
attention to menu items that
may contain those allergens.

00:01:36.199 --> 00:01:40.840
These alerts are designed to give you
additional information while browsing,

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.298
but you should always review the full
ingredient and allergen information

00:01:45.298 --> 00:01:49.085
provided for an item if
you have a food allergy.

00:01:49.085 --> 00:01:54.787
Next, I recommend checking your account
details and notification settings.

00:01:54.787 --> 00:02:00.488
Add your mobile phone number here, so your
contact information is always up to date.

00:02:00.488 --> 00:02:02.625
Then, turn on email reminders.

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:07.185
You can be reminded 24 hours or
2 hours before the order cutoff,

00:02:07.185 --> 00:02:11.271
and choose which accounts
you'd like reminders for.

00:02:11.271 --> 00:02:15.361
These reminders help make sure
you never miss an upcoming order

00:02:15.361 --> 00:02:19.773
deadline — especially if you
don't log into HUNGRY every day.

00:02:19.773 --> 00:02:21.911
When you're done, click Save Profile.

00:02:21.911 --> 00:02:27.159
You can always come back to your settings
later if you want to make changes.

00:02:27.159 --> 00:02:30.309
Now, let's place an order.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:37.428
From your Group Order page, you'll see
your available upcoming meal dates.

00:02:37.428 --> 00:02:42.913
Select the date you want to order for,
and you'll be taken to the available menu.

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:47.732
Each menu item includes information
to help you decide what you'd like,

00:02:47.732 --> 00:02:52.594
including the meal description
and available dietary information.

00:02:52.594 --> 00:02:55.576
You can scroll through
the full menu or use the

00:02:55.576 --> 00:02:59.351
available filters to
narrow down your options.

00:02:59.351 --> 00:03:02.444
If you have dietary
preferences or restrictions,

00:03:02.444 --> 00:03:06.183
you don't have to scroll
through every single item.

00:03:06.183 --> 00:03:11.536
Use the dietary filters to narrow the
menu based on what you're looking for.

00:03:11.536 --> 00:03:15.444
For example, you can filter
for options such as vegetarian,

00:03:15.444 --> 00:03:20.268
vegan, or gluten-free, depending
on what's available on your menu.

00:03:20.268 --> 00:03:25.818
This makes it much easier to focus on
the meals that are relevant to you.

00:03:27.417 --> 00:03:32.095
Remember that dietary labels and
allergen alerts serve different purposes,

00:03:32.095 --> 00:03:36.330
so if you have a food allergy, you
should still review the allergen

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:40.471
information for the individual
meal before ordering.

00:03:40.471 --> 00:03:45.122
Once you find something you like,
click on the meal to view its details.

00:03:45.122 --> 00:03:49.110
Depending on the meal, you may
also have options to customize

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:53.354
your selection or choose
available sides or modifications.

00:03:53.354 --> 00:03:57.435
Review your selections and
then add the meal to your cart.

00:03:57.435 --> 00:04:00.512
You can continue browsing
if you want to make changes,

00:04:00.512 --> 00:04:03.735
or head to your cart when you're ready.

00:04:09.128 --> 00:04:11.596
Once you're happy with your selection,

00:04:11.596 --> 00:04:14.583
open your cart and review
your order one final

00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:15.360
time.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.630
Double-check the meal, delivery date,

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.212
and location to make sure
everything looks correct.

00:04:21.212 --> 00:04:24.693
Then select Place Order
to complete your order.

00:04:24.693 --> 00:04:28.782
And once your order has been
submitted, you're all set!

00:04:28.782 --> 00:04:34.263
If you need to come back later, you can
view your upcoming orders from My Orders.

00:04:34.263 --> 00:04:38.644
Depending on your company's ordering
rules and whether the order cutoff

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:43.414
has passed, you may also be able to
make changes to an upcoming order.

00:04:43.414 --> 00:04:48.196
Just make sure to make any updates
before your Group Order deadline.

00:04:48.196 --> 00:04:50.227
And that's it!

00:04:50.227 --> 00:04:52.835
Once you've set up your default location,

00:04:52.835 --> 00:04:55.189
dietary preferences, allergen alerts,

00:04:55.189 --> 00:04:59.514
phone number, and notifications,
your day-to-day ordering experience

00:04:59.514 --> 00:05:01.429
should be pretty quick.

00:05:01.429 --> 00:05:04.344
When it's time to order,
simply log into HUNGRY,

00:05:04.344 --> 00:05:08.414
select your upcoming Group Order,
find the meal that works for you,

00:05:08.414 --> 00:05:10.931
and check out before the deadline.

00:05:10.931 --> 00:05:14.031
Thanks, and happy ordering!
